{
  "name": "PrimeCut: chunk a file and insert the chunksets into Qdrant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Download file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "document",
        "operation": "chunk",
        "source": "binary",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "wait": true,
        "timeout": 600,
        "returnKind": "chunksets",
        "simplify": true,
        "chunkOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Chunk document",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-primecut.primeCut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "qdrantCollection": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "primecut-demo"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Qdrant Vector Store",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Embeddings OpenAI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "jsonData": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "textSplittingMode": "custom",
        "options": {
          "metadata": {
            "metadataValues": [
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "={{ $json.page }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "heading",
                "value": "={{ $json.heading }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "fileName",
                "value": "={{ $json.fileName }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "chunksetIndex",
                "value": "={{ $json.chunksetIndex }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "canonicalUrl",
                "value": "={{ $json.canonicalUrl }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Default Data Loader",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        880,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 100000,
        "chunkOverlap": 0
      },
      "name": "Character Text Splitter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chunk a file, insert chunksets into Qdrant\n\n1. Add credentials: **PrimeCut API** on the PrimeCut node, Qdrant and OpenAI on their nodes.\n2. The Default Data Loader is set to **Load Specific Data** with `{{ $json.text }}` and **Custom** text splitting; the Character Text Splitter below it uses a chunk size of 100000 so PrimeCut's chunksets are **not split again**. Keep these settings: n8n's default loader re-chunks at 1000 characters and drops the metadata.\n3. The loader's Metadata maps `page`, `heading`, `fileName`, `chunksetIndex` and `canonicalUrl` from each item so agents can cite sources.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -340
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking 'Execute workflow'": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download file",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download file": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Chunk document",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Chunk document": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Qdrant Vector Store",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Embeddings OpenAI": {
      "ai_embedding": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Qdrant Vector Store",
            "type": "ai_embedding",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Default Data Loader": {
      "ai_document": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Qdrant Vector Store",
            "type": "ai_document",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Character Text Splitter": {
      "ai_textSplitter": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Default Data Loader",
            "type": "ai_textSplitter",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
